§§ `Sections 79, 79.1 and 79.2 -- the proportion for a year of a division`

-- For a year of a division the proportion is the unadjusted pensionable earnings attributed by the division, over the
-- total for the year determined for the division.
GIVEN attributed IS A NUMBER
      total IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`cp5 helper -- the proportion that earnings attributed are of the total` attributed total MEANS
    IF total EQUALS 0 THEN NOTHING ELSE JUST (attributed DIVIDED BY total)

